## 5. Browser check against a REAL local stack (not mocks)
stack: PostgreSQL 18 with docs/sql/v2/001+002, Supabase Auth (GoTrue) v2.197.0 (the binary CI uses), server.app serving web/dist on http://localhost:8765
(the fixture of tests/test_r204_accounts_live.py, unchanged). Sandbox Chrome.
- sign-up owner@demo.test -> «تحقق من بريدك» (confirmation required); sign-in before confirmation -> «البريد لم يُؤكَّد بعد…» (403); confirmed (SQL, local only) -> sign-in OK.
- created workspace «فريق التجربة»; invitation for member@demo.test (role member) -> link shown once; after reload not shown again; pending row with «إلغاء».
- browser storage after sign-in: localStorage = {agos_workspace: <id>} only; sessionStorage = {}; document.cookie = "" (refresh cookie is HttpOnly).
- reload -> session restored without password.
- sign-out -> sign-in form; invitation link opened in the SAME page while signed out -> ignored (defect 1, section 2); full load -> picked up, URL cleaned to "/".
- after fix: same-page hash -> banner shown, URL cleaned; member@demo.test accepted -> «انضممت إلى المساحة بدور عضو»; member view: no role select, no rename/delete,
  no invitation form, «مغادرة» only; members (2) list shows the owner.
- owner view before fix offered «مغادرة» to the only owner (defect 2); plain .btn buttons rendered with the browser default white background and the delete
  button stretched full width -> fixed (btn-ghost, align-self) and re-checked by screenshot.
- sign-out + reload -> sign-in form; GET /api/v2/workspaces without token = 401; POST /api/v2/auth/refresh with the old cookie = 401 (session really ended).

